# Setting a due date from the command menu while editing returns to editing at the same caret.
file <<END
- Party
END
keys <Enter> <Left> <Left>
type /due
see Set Due Date
keys <Enter>
see Due date
type tomorrow
keys <Enter>
type Z
keys <Esc>
see - ParZty
see tomorrow
quit
saved <<END
- ParZty @due({today+1})
END
